    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/74a3b160-da13-4a87-948f-fa1fc4a3da27-image.png\" style=\"width: 481px; height: 226px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Then,&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>then&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;i.e.,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
